From: MrUnforsaken
Date: 2026-05-25
Subject: [PATCH 0006] Add camera_device config, V4L2 NV12 capture, same-device IR/AI reuse

Add camera_device field to FaceMethodConfig (Rust + C++).
Add V4L2NV12CameraSession that extracts Y-plane as greyscale, with GREY fallback.
Detect same-device (camera == IR camera) to reuse primary session and disable AI anti-spoofing (trained on RGB, fails on IR).

